  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing gender equality in Caribbean SIDS through policy advice, capacity development and knowledge production</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Action will be taken to promote and advance gender equality in Caribbean SIDS. This will include enhancing capacities of Member States to address negative gender stereotypes and gender norms. Focus will also be made on championing the Flagship Changing MENtalities. Issues pertaining to reduction of different forms of discrimination, GBV and the economic empowerment of women will also be reinforced. Gender transformative programming, capacity development and knowledge production will contribute to inform inclusive and sustainable policymaking.</narrative>
  </description>
